"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[9289],{39289:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"slug":"vvod-izhs-2026-upal-na-21-procent-eskrou","locale":"en","title":"Detached-home completions fall 21% over 9 months to the lowest level since 2021","description":"Detached-home completions fell 21% to 41.4 million square meters in January–September 2026. How escrow and expensive credit are reshaping housebuilding.","blocks":[{"id":"b001","kind":"paragraph","text":"Russia completed 66.3 million square meters of housing over 9 months of 2026, 13.4% less than a year earlier. The entire decline came from detached homes, with 41.4 million square meters completed, down 21%. The last lower figure was 35.1 million in 2021. Apartment-building completions instead increased by 3% to 24.9 million square meters. Detached homes\' share of all completions fell by 5.9 percentage points over the year to 62.5%."},{"id":"b002","kind":"paragraph","text":"Among the 5 largest building regions, completions fell most in Moscow Region and Kuban. Moscow Region delivered 6.9 million square meters over 9 months, down 29.5%; Krasnodar Territory delivered 3.1 million, down 31.7%. Cian lead analyst Elena Bobrovskaya cites expensive credit and economic stagnation as common causes. Detached homes also face the shift to escrow and the fading effect of the simplified country-house registration amnesty. Starkwood\'s Vyacheslav Astafyev estimates project budgets rose 10–15% over the year, faster than inflation."},{"id":"b003","kind":"paragraph","text":"Imagine a tailor whose customer deposits payment at a bank but can release it only after trying on the completed suit. The tailor pays for fabric, thread and an assistant\'s wages from savings or credit. A large atelier can manage this; a small workshop may not. That is how escrow works. From March 1, 2025, a contractor building a home under a subsidized mortgage receives payment only this way: within 5 working days after the home is registered. About 1.5 thousand contractors currently use escrow for detached homes."},{"id":"b004","kind":"paragraph","text":"The second factor is statistical. Detached-home completions are counted upon registration, and the country-house amnesty long boosted the total as owners registered homes built earlier. It contributed up to 25–30% of detached-home completions. Simplified registration has been extended to 2031, but M9 Development operations director Anton Minedzhyan considers its effect almost exhausted. Part of the decline therefore reflects old homes already being registered, rather than less new construction."},{"id":"b005","kind":"paragraph","text":"September detached-home completions increased for the first time in 2026, by 4% to 5.3 million square meters. In the same month, detached-home mortgage issuance rose by 42% from August to almost 17 thousand. Families hurried before October 1, when one-child family mortgage rates rose from 6% to 10–12%. Loans used for construction will affect completions only later."},{"id":"b006","kind":"paragraph","text":"The Construction Ministry expects 87.7 million square meters of housing in 2026, about 20% less than in 2025, and almost 25% less detached housing. That is worse than the 9-month result, implying a sharper decline toward year-end. Families planning to build with subsidized mortgages are limited to bank-approved contractors, while estimates rise faster than prices. Large developers could replace small crews, but settlements need roads and utilities before the first sales."},{"id":"b007","kind":"heading","text":"How much have detached-home completions fallen in 2026?"},{"id":"b008","kind":"paragraph","text":"January–September 2026 saw 41.4 million square meters of detached homes completed, 21% less than a year earlier. Only 2021 was lower, at 35.1 million. Total housing completions fell by 13% to 66.3 million square meters."},{"id":"b009","kind":"heading","text":"How does escrow work for building a detached home?"},{"id":"b010","kind":"paragraph","text":"The borrower\'s money stays in a bank account; the contractor receives it within 5 working days after the home is registered. Construction uses the contractor\'s own or borrowed funds. Since March 1, 2025, this is compulsory for contractor-built homes under subsidized mortgages."},{"id":"b011","kind":"heading","text":"Are detached-home completions recovering?"},{"id":"b012","kind":"paragraph","text":"September completions rose by 4% year-on-year for the first time in 2026. But the Construction Ministry expects detached housing to fall almost 25% over the full year, more than over 9 months. From October 1, family mortgages for one-child households rose to 10–12%, potentially reducing demand for houses."}],"sources":[{"label":"Falling short on floor space: Russian detached-home completions decline 21%","url":"https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/9042244"},{"label":"Russian housing completions fall 13.4% over three quarters","url":"https://1prime.ru/20261019/rosstat-874384990.html"},{"label":"September detached-home completions exceed last year\'s level for the first time in 2026","url":"https://finance.mail.ru/article/v-sentyabre-vvod-izhs-vpervyie-v-2026-m-prevyisil-uroven-proshlogo-goda-69233224/"},{"label":"Russian housing completions decline 13% over three quarters","url":"https://realty.ria.ru/20261019/vvod-2125392621.html"},{"label":"Changes to Federal Law 186: what detached-home mortgage participants should know","url":"https://harant.ru/blog/bankovskie-voprosy-finansy/izmeneniya-v-186-fz-chto-vazhno-znat-uchastnikam-ipotechnogo-rynka-izhs/"}],"sourceBodySha256":"bcf9ff6044973cdce07fbb0598c5351b940a456fbe7c887a552863309c39870a"}')}}]);